			"Message": "chore(Project): Update Echo and Mountain submodules with IPC fixes and refactors\n\n**Echo:**\nUpdate submodule to latest revision (b084a820..7a0615ed).\n\n**Mountain:**\nStandardize binary and service entry points by renaming descriptive identifiers (e.g., `ExtensionPopulate`, `CocoonStart`) to the universal `Fn` convention, aligning with `WindServiceHandlers`. Normalize `AppLifecycle.rs` and `Entry.rs`.\n\nRefactor the `Mountain` ↔ `Cocoon` IPC for `sky:model:contentChanged` to prevent null dereferences. Validate `Uri` existence before accessing `Payload` fields and restrict `cocoon-main` notifications to existing documents. Add explicit `u32` casts for `Line` and `Character` when constructing `PositionDTO`.\n\nUpdate `.gitignore` to correctly distinguish the `Mountain` binary from the `Target/debug/Mountain/` artifact directory and remove tracked `index.html` artifacts.\n\nEnsures type safety in IPC, prevents runtime crashes on missing documents, and maintains clean build artifacts.",
